# Multi-Tenant Employee & HR SaaS Platform — Module Research

## 1. Authentication

**Purpose:** Handles user registration, login, logout, password management, and authentication.

**Main Users:** Employees, HR, Managers, Administrators.

**Important Data:** User ID, email, password hash, authentication status, tokens, tenant ID.

**Expected APIs:**
- POST `/api/auth/register`
- POST `/api/auth/login`
- POST `/api/auth/logout`
- POST `/api/auth/refresh-token`
- POST `/api/auth/forgot-password`

**Dependencies:** Users, Organizations/Tenants, Roles & Permissions.

---

## 2. Users

**Purpose:** Manages user accounts and their relationship with the organization.

**Main Users:** Administrators, HR, Managers.

**Important Data:** User ID, name, email, status, tenant ID, role.

**Expected APIs:**
- GET `/api/users`
- GET `/api/users/{id}`
- POST `/api/users`
- PUT `/api/users/{id}`
- DELETE `/api/users/{id}`

**Dependencies:** Authentication, Organizations/Tenants, Roles & Permissions.

---

## 3. Organizations / Tenants

**Purpose:** Manages customer organizations using the SaaS platform.

**Main Users:** Platform Administrators, Organization Administrators.

**Important Data:** Tenant ID, organization name, contact details, status, configuration.

**Expected APIs:**
- POST `/api/tenants`
- GET `/api/tenants/{id}`
- PUT `/api/tenants/{id}`
- DELETE `/api/tenants/{id}`

**Dependencies:** Users, Subscriptions, Billing.

---

## 4. Employees

**Purpose:** Manages employee profiles and employment information.

**Main Users:** HR, Managers, Employees.

**Important Data:** Employee ID, name, email, phone, department, designation, joining date, tenant ID.

**Expected APIs:**
- GET `/api/employees`
- GET `/api/employees/{id}`
- POST `/api/employees`
- PUT `/api/employees/{id}`
- DELETE `/api/employees/{id}`

**Dependencies:** Departments, Attendance, Leave Management, Payroll.

---

## 5. Departments

**Purpose:** Manages departments within an organization.

**Main Users:** HR, Administrators, Managers.

**Important Data:** Department ID, department name, manager, tenant ID.

**Expected APIs:**
- GET `/api/departments`
- GET `/api/departments/{id}`
- POST `/api/departments`
- PUT `/api/departments/{id}`
- DELETE `/api/departments/{id}`

**Dependencies:** Organizations, Employees.

---

## 6. Attendance

**Purpose:** Tracks employee attendance, working hours, check-in, and check-out.

**Main Users:** Employees, HR, Managers.

**Important Data:** Employee ID, date, check-in time, check-out time, attendance status, working hours.

**Expected APIs:**
- POST `/api/attendance/check-in`
- POST `/api/attendance/check-out`
- GET `/api/attendance`
- GET `/api/attendance/employee/{employeeId}`

**Dependencies:** Employees, Users.

---

## 7. Leave Management

**Purpose:** Allows employees to request leave and managers/HR to approve or reject requests.

**Main Users:** Employees, Managers, HR.

**Important Data:** Leave ID, employee ID, leave type, start date, end date, reason, status.

**Expected APIs:**
- POST `/api/leaves`
- GET `/api/leaves`
- GET `/api/leaves/{id}`
- PUT `/api/leaves/{id}/approve`
- PUT `/api/leaves/{id}/reject`

**Dependencies:** Employees, Users, Notifications.

---

## 8. Payroll

**Purpose:** Manages employee salary and payroll processing.

**Main Users:** HR, Payroll Administrators, Employees.

**Important Data:** Employee ID, salary, allowances, deductions, tax, pay period, net salary.

**Expected APIs:**
- GET `/api/payroll`
- GET `/api/payroll/{id}`
- POST `/api/payroll`
- PUT `/api/payroll/{id}`

**Dependencies:** Employees, Departments, Attendance, Leave Management.

---

## 9. Notifications

**Purpose:** Sends system notifications for important events and actions.

**Main Users:** Employees, Managers, HR, Administrators.

**Important Data:** Notification ID, recipient, message, type, status, created date.

**Expected APIs:**
- GET `/api/notifications`
- PUT `/api/notifications/{id}/read`
- POST `/api/notifications/send`

**Dependencies:** Users, Leave Management, Attendance, Payroll.

---

## 10. Reports

**Purpose:** Provides HR and management reports about employees and organizational activities.

**Main Users:** HR, Managers, Administrators.

**Important Data:** Employee data, attendance, leave, payroll, department information.

**Expected APIs:**
- GET `/api/reports/employees`
- GET `/api/reports/attendance`
- GET `/api/reports/leave`
- GET `/api/reports/payroll`

**Dependencies:** Employees, Attendance, Leave Management, Payroll.

---

## 11. Roles & Permissions

**Purpose:** Controls what users can access and what actions they can perform.

**Main Users:** Administrators, HR.

**Important Data:** Role ID, role name, permission ID, permission name, user-role mapping.

**Expected APIs:**
- GET `/api/roles`
- POST `/api/roles`
- PUT `/api/roles/{id}`
- GET `/api/permissions`
- POST `/api/roles/{id}/permissions`

**Dependencies:** Users, Organizations/Tenants, Authentication.

In a multi-tenant system, authorization should enforce both the user's permissions and the tenant boundary.

---

## 12. Subscriptions

**Purpose:** Manages the subscription plan selected by each organization.

**Main Users:** Organization Administrators, Platform Administrators.

**Important Data:** Subscription ID, tenant ID, plan, start date, end date, status, features.

**Expected APIs:**
- GET `/api/subscriptions`
- GET `/api/subscriptions/{id}`
- POST `/api/subscriptions`
- PUT `/api/subscriptions/{id}`

**Dependencies:** Organizations/Tenants, Billing.

---

## 13. Billing

**Purpose:** Manages invoices, payments, billing information, and subscription charges.

**Main Users:** Organization Administrators, Platform Administrators.

**Important Data:** Invoice ID, tenant ID, amount, payment status, billing date, payment reference.

**Expected APIs:**
- GET `/api/billing/invoices`
- GET `/api/billing/invoices/{id}`
- POST `/api/billing/invoices`
- GET `/api/billing/payments`

**Dependencies:** Organizations/Tenants, Subscriptions.

---

## 14. Audit Logs

**Purpose:** Records important user and system activities for security, troubleshooting, and auditing.

**Main Users:** Administrators, Auditors, Platform Administrators.

**Important Data:** Log ID, user ID, tenant ID, action, resource, timestamp, IP address, result.

**Expected APIs:**
- GET `/api/audit-logs`
- GET `/api/audit-logs/{id}`

**Dependencies:** Users, Organizations/Tenants, Roles & Permissions.

---

