# Conclusion

The Multi-Tenant Employee & HR SaaS Platform contains modules for authentication, tenant management, employees, HR operations, access control, subscriptions, billing, notifications, reporting, and auditing. Each module should operate within the correct tenant context so that one organization's data cannot be accessed by another organization.